  ;; The transport half of the remote authorities. `grant.net` decides which
  ;; URLs may be reached and `grant.cloud` decides which storage and inference
  ;; requests are asked for at all (ADR-0041, ADR-0042); `grant.anchors` decides
  ;; which keys an https peer may present (ADR-0045). All three moved. What is
  ;; still here is the code that opens the connection once those three have
