  ;; `java.net.http`. TCB for the same reason as the file above and one more of
  ;; its own -- it holds the `tls.client` `:verify-chain` function, which is the
  ;; whole of the peer decision on that path. A change here that returned
  ;; `[:ok …]` without asking `grant.cloud/admit-peer` would accept any peer,
